# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere — in the repo and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, Git's core.autocrlf on Windows rewrites checkouts to CRLF while
# Prettier is configured with endOfLine: lf. CI runs `format:check` on
# windows-latest against a fresh checkout, so the two would disagree and the
# build would fail on a tree nobody had touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.exe binary
